B.bmr=s(["Read the net worth and this month at the top; tap it for the full wealth summary.","Under Sources, tap a source to see its records.","Use the arrows of Day by day to look at another day; All records opens the Records section.","Scan receipt, Ask Thara and Bank inbox are shortcuts on this page."],t.s)
B.ajE=new A.df("today","Today","The first section: net worth, how this month is going, the sources with their balances, what falls due next, goals, and the records of the day, day by day.",B.bmr)
B.bFD=s(["Tap the chips All, Expense, Income, Transfer or Family to show one kind.","Use the search at the top to find a record by its words; pick a source or a type to narrow the list, and Clear filters to see all again.","Tap a record to see its details, edit or delete it; or hold it and slide it.","Add a record with the + button."],t.s)
B.ak4=new A.df("records","Records","The ledger: every record that moved money (expenses, income, transfers, family records), newest first.",B.bFD)
