B.ajB=new A.df("chat","Ask Thara (chat)","The typed chat with Thara AI: questions about the wallet, drafts of records and plans, and answers to anything.",B.bGU)
B.bcF=s(["Type the source name.","Choose its type and currency.","Type the opening balance: what it holds today.","Count in net worth is on by default; turn it off for money the user only looks after.","Press Save source."],t.s)
B.ajA=new A.df("new_source","New source","Adds a place money is kept: cash, a bank account, a card, a wallet or savings. Every record belongs to a source.",B.bcF)
B.bLd=s(["Type the name and the amount.","Set the next due date and how it repeats.","Choose the payment source (or leave it to be asked each time).","Press Save obligation. It then shows under Due."],t.s)
B.ajr=new A.df("new_bill","New bill or debt","A new obligation: rent, a loan, a subscription, a bill, with its amount and next due date, once or repeating.",B.bLd)
B.bso=s(["Type the name and the target.","Optionally pick a target date.","Choose the sources that hold the money, so its progress follows their balance.","Press Save goal."],t.s)
B.ajy=new A.df("new_goal","New savings goal","A goal to save for: a name, a target amount and an optional date, and the sources that hold the money for it.",B.bso)
B.bIx=s(["Check or change the amount.","Choose the source the money comes from.","Press Save."],t.s)
B.ajR=new A.df("add_to_goal","Add to my goal","Money towards the main goal: a transfer into the source that holds it, with the next step's amount filled in. With no goal yet it opens the goal editor.",B.bIx)
B.bon=s(["Type the list name and press Save list.","Add items with a name and, if known, a price."],t.s)
B.ajN=new A.df("new_shopping_list","New shopping list","A new shopping list, opened once it is named.",B.bon)
B.bEZ=s(["Tap a plan to read it, then start it.","Fill in its settings and save; it then measures each week or month."],t.s)
B.ajT=new A.df("new_budget_plan","Choose a plan","The catalog of plans to start: budgets (50/30/20, by category, an expense plan), saving plans (pay yourself first, 52-week challenge, daily saving and more), an emergency fund, debt payoff, zakat and others.",B.bEZ)
B.bpP=s(["Type the name and the amount.","Choose the source and the payday.","Press Save schedule."],t.s)
B.ajs=new A.df("new_payday","New expected income","An income schedule: a name, an amount, the source it arrives in and the payday each month. On that day Thara asks whether it arrived; nothing is recorded before the user confirms.",B.bpP)
B.bIv=s(["Type the circle name and the contribution.","Set weekly or monthly, the start, the members and the user's turn.","Choose the payment source.","Press Save circle."],t.s)
B.aki=new A.df("new_gameya","Set up a gameya","A new savings circle (gameya): how much everyone pays, how often, and which turn the user collects.",B.bIv)
B.bFB=s(["Type the name, the weight and pick the karat.","Optionally what was paid (Thara can then record the purchase).","Press Save holding."],t.s)
B.ak9=new A.df("new_gold","Add a gold piece","A gold holding: a name, its weight in grams and its karat, valued at the recorded gold price.",B.bFB)
B.b4f=s(["Tap a source to see its details and recent records; from there add a record, a transfer, or edit it.","Add source adds a new one; Hide archived shows or hides old ones.","Balance check compares a source with the balance the user sees in their bank."],t.s)
B.ajY=new A.df("sources","Sources","Every source with its balance, and assets minus debt.",B.b4f)
B.bLg=s(["Read it; Open the full statistics leads to Analysis."],t.s)
B.ajU=new A.df("wealth_summary","Wealth summary","What the user owns less what they owe: money held in sources, gold at the recorded price, debt sources, and the split by kind of source and by currency, plus this month's income, spending and what is left over.",B.bLg)
B.bsA=s(["Choose the source.","Type the observed balance and compare.","If they differ, Record the difference adds a record for it."],t.s)
B.ajH=new A.df("balance_check","Check a balance","Reconciles a source: the user types the balance they really see, and Thara compares it with its own.",B.bsA)
B.bKi=s(["Pick This month, This year or Other dates at the top.","Read the figures and their change from before.","Tap a chart name to switch charts; tap a type to see its records.","More analysis opens the full statistics."],t.s)
B.ajx=new A.df("analysis","Analysis","Statistics: spending, income, savings rate and spending per day for this month, this year or other dates, and charts (cash flow, net worth, categories, sources, days, budget, biggest).",B.bKi)
B.btp=s(["Tap a payment to see it; mark it paid from there (a record is made), skip it, or undo a payment.","New obligation adds a bill or debt."],t.s)
B.akn=new A.df("due","Due","Bills, installments and recurring payments coming due, with what is overdue.",B.btp)
B.biV=s(["Tap a waiting message to review the record Thara read in it.","Add it as a record, or dismiss it.","All messages shows every message; How far back picks the time.","Import settings choose what is read."],t.s)
B.akc=new A.df("bank_messages","Bank messages","Bank, wallet and InstaPay text messages Thara read on the phone, as suggested records waiting for review; nothing is recorded by itself unless the user switched auto-record on.",B.biV)
B.bsh=s(["Tap one to edit, archive, merge or delete it.","Add category: type a name, choose its kind and icon, Save category."],t.s)
B.aka=new A.df("categories","Categories","The types (categories) records are labelled with, for spending and income, each with an icon and an optional monthly limit.",B.bsh)
B.bzC=s(["Add piece adds a holding.","Tap a piece to edit it, or record a sale (it opens an income record).","The gold price is set under Exchange rates."],t.s)
B.akh=new A.df("gold","Gold holdings","Gold pieces with their weight, purity and today's value at the recorded gold price.",B.bzC)
B.byW=s(["Tap a goal to see its pace, milestones and the records that moved it; from there Add to goal, edit, pause or make it the main goal.","New goal adds one."],t.s)
B.ak2=new A.df("goals","Goals","Savings goals, the main goal first: saved so far, what is left, the pace needed each week or month, and the saving plan feeding them.",B.byW)
B.bxW=s(["Tap a plan to open it: its targets, its lines and what is over or under, with Settings to change it, pause, resume or finish it.","Find a plan opens the catalog."],t.s)
B.ajC=new A.df("plans","My plans","The user's budget and saving plans: the active one with what is left to spend or to set aside, plans that need attention, and the rest.",B.bxW)
B.bvK=s(["Choose the start and end dates.","Read the net worth on the end date and the payments, goals and income included."],t.s)
B.ajz=new A.df("outlook","Cash flow outlook","A projection: how recurring payments, expected income and goals due change the money available and the net worth between two dates.",B.bvK)
B.bEs=s(["When a payday comes, answer Has it arrived?: confirming writes the income record (or uses one already in the ledger).","New adds a schedule; tap one to edit it."],t.s)
B.akk=new A.df("income","Expected income","Income that is scheduled to come in, like a salary, with the next one expected and whether it arrived.",B.bEs)
B.by1=s(["Tap a debt source to see it.","New purchase plans an installment purchase."],t.s)
B.ajV=new A.df("owed","What I owe","Debts: the total owed, what is due this month, debt sources (cards, loans) and installment plans.",B.by1)
B.bDw=s(["Type the purchase price and the payment details the page asks for.","Save purchase adds a debt source for what is financed, a record of the purchase, and the monthly payment under Due."],t.s)
B.ajP=new A.df("installments","Installment purchase","Plans a purchase paid in installments: compares the down payment with the monthly commitment and the true cost.",B.bDw)
B.brF=s(["Create a family account or join one with an invitation.","Tap an account to see its records and members; records waiting for the user show at the top."],t.s)
B.aju=new A.df("family","Family accounts","Shared ledgers with people the user trusts: shared sources, members, their limits and their records. Needs a Thara account.",B.brF)
B.bCa=s(["Tap a circle to see what the user owes or is owed.","Record a contribution, or Collect payout on the user's turn.","Create a Gameya, or join one with an invitation code from its organizer."],t.s)
B.akg=new A.df("gameya","Gameya","Savings circles: the next contribution, the expected payout and the turns.",B.bCa)
