B.ajF=new A.df("home_widgets","Home screen widgets","Widgets for the phone's home screen: New record, Goals & plans, Shopping & goals, and what they may show.",B.bfy)
B.bEH=s(["Turn App lock on and choose a PIN of 4 digits.","Choose how soon it asks again.","Backup & restore and Device permissions are linked from here."],t.s)
B.akm=new A.df("security","Privacy & app lock","The app lock (a PIN of 4 digits, and the fingerprint where the phone has one) and how long Thara may stay in the background before asking again. A forgotten PIN is reset from the lock screen through the Thara account (password, Google or a code by email); nothing is erased.",B.bEH)
B.baD=s(["Switch each kind on or off; Remind me at picks the hour."],t.s)
